# Feline Sovereign gives "other Cats you control" +1/+1 and protection from Dogs (CR 702.16e, 702.16f, layers 7c and 6). Bot1 has Feline
# Sovereign (2/3, not "other"), Sacred Cat (a 1/1 Cat, so 2/2), and Grizzly Bears (not a Cat: 2/2, no protection). Bot2's own
# Sacred Cat (1/1) gets nothing: "you control". On turn 4 both Dogs attack with Bot2's Cat; Bot1 blocks one Dog with Feline Sovereign,
# which is dealt damage, and the other with Sacred Cat, whose damage from a Dog is prevented, though it kills the Dog. Bot2's
# unblocked Cat hits Bot1 for 1 without triggering Bot1's Feline Sovereign (it is not Bot1's Cat).
